<h1 class="guide-title">What 545 Bookings Reveal About Bradenton &amp; Sarasota Vacation Trends (2026)</h1>
<p class="guide-meta">Published March 16, 2026 &bull; By Sawyer Beckett, Seascape Vacations &bull; 12 min read</p>

<div class="guide-content">

<!-- Quick Stats Box -->
